# Gangsters — index

Модульные rules по слоям. Детали MUST/MUST NOT — в scoped rule по glob; здесь только карта и маршрутизация.

## Карта слоёв

| Слой | Путь | Rule file |
|------|------|-----------|
| Domain | `app/Domain/**` | `backend-domain.mdc` |
| Application | `app/Application/**` | `backend-application.mdc` |
| Infrastructure | `app/Infrastructure/**` | `backend-infrastructure.mdc` |
| HTTP (API) | `app/Http/**` | `backend-http.mdc` |
| Filament (admin) | `app/Filament/**` | `backend-filament.mdc` |
| Composition | Providers, Shared, Support, Console, Models, Exceptions | `backend-composition.mdc` |
| Frontend application | features, processes, stores, api, domain, domainEvents | `frontend-application.mdc` |
| Frontend presentation | components, layouts, design, pages, router, css | `frontend-presentation.mdc` |
| Testing | `tests/**` | `testing-architecture.mdc` |

## Глобальные MUST (кратко)

1. Направление зависимостей: **Domain ← Application ← Infrastructure**; Delivery **write** → Application only. Filament **read may** `App\Infrastructure\**\Model` + `app/Filament/Support/*` (без `GetAdmin*Query` / Infra read-repos из UI).
2. Бизнес-сценарии — `App\Application\**`, не `App\Services\*` и не fat controllers/resources.
3. Admin UI — только **5 hubs** в `AdminPanelProvider` (`docs/admin-filament-hubs.md`).
4. Корзина/checkout/favorites — **server SoT**; frontend stores = cache (`frontend-application.mdc`).
5. Границы BC — `docs/architecture/bounded-context-dependency-matrix.md`; enforcement — `tests/Unit/Architecture/*`.

## Decision tree

| Редактирую… | Читаю rule | Делаю изменения в… |
|-------------|------------|-------------------|
| Entity, VO, domain event, repo interface | backend-domain | `app/Domain/{Context}/` |
| Use case, query, DTO, presenter, contract | backend-application | `app/Application/{Slice}/` |
| Eloquent, repo impl, listener, adapter | backend-infrastructure | `app/Infrastructure/{Context}/` |
| API controller, middleware, FormRequest | backend-http | `app/Http/` + `routes/api.php` |
| Hub, TableWidget, Resource, FormMapper | backend-filament | `app/Filament/{Hub}/` + Application **Command** UseCase (write) |
| ServiceProvider, DI, Support, Console | backend-composition | Provider / Shared / Support |
| Pinia, features, processes, api helper | frontend-application | `resources/js/features|stores|api/` |
| Vue component, design token, layout, GSAP | frontend-presentation | `resources/js/components|design|layouts/` |
| Unit/Feature test | testing-architecture | `tests/Unit` или `tests/Feature/{Api|Admin}` |

**Новая фича end-to-end:** Application (use case) → Infrastructure (если нужен port) → Http или Filament → Feature test.

**Новая admin-вкладка:** Filament read (Eloquent / `Filament/Support`) + Application **Command** UseCase (write) → `Feature/Admin` smoke.

**Новая кнопка корзины в UI:** emit `CART_*_REQUESTED` → process → command → store → API (не axios в component).

